 "summary": "The new public H\u00f6lder lemmas (add-constant, comp-left and affine change of variables on a set, the restricted inverse chart, and the inverse of a multiplication operator) have no existing equivalent in Mathlib or TauCeti; the matches found are bounded-space operators, isometry-only versions or scalar-rescaling versions. The PR reuses the existing inverse and Leibniz H\u00f6lder API and removes the duplicate proofs it replaces: the old \u03b1 = 1/2 helpers, the bounded comp-left proof and the chart-pullback proof.",
